# Patterns to exclude from doctor.sh secret scan.
# One regex per line. Lines starting with # are comments.
# Each pattern matches a substring of the apparent secret; matches are ignored.
#
# Placeholders we use in templates:
__TOOLKIT_HOME__
EXAMPLE_TOKEN
PLACEHOLDER
#
# Suppress matches that are themselves regex literals (containing regex
# metacharacters — real PEM headers do not contain these):
\[\^
\.\* PRIVATE
